  "chapter": {
    "number": 7,
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 6,
        "content": [
          "He answered and said unto them,",
          {
            "text": "Well hath Esaias prophesied of you hypocrites, as it is written, This people honoureth me with their lips, but their heart is far from me.",
            "wordsOfJesus": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 7,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Howbeit in vain do they worship me, teaching for doctrines the commandments of men.",
            "wordsOfJesus": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "line_break",
        "paragraph": "p"
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 14,
        "content": [
          "¶ And when he had called all the people unto him, he said unto them,",
          {
            "text": "Hearken unto me every one of you, and understand:",
            "wordsOfJesus": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 15,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "There is nothing from without a man, that entering into him can defile him: but the things which come out of him, those are they that defile the man.",
            "wordsOfJesus": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 16,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "If any man have ears to hear, let him hear.",
            "wordsOfJesus": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 17,
        "content": [
          "And when he was entered into the house from the people, his disciples asked him concerning the parable."
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 18,
        "content": [
          "And he saith unto them,",
          {
            "text": "Are ye so without understanding also? Do ye not perceive, that whatsoever thing from without entereth into the man, it cannot defile him;",
            "wordsOfJesus": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "footnotes": []
